{"id":384,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"礼と学びを軸に品性と学識を養う女子一貫教育","feature_description":"桜蔭学園は中高6年間を通じて一貫した女子教育を行い、「礼と学び」の心を育てます。中学校では時代に適応した学習と道徳の指導を通して、品性と学識を備えた人間形成を目指します。読書、友人との議論、実験、レポート作成など自ら学びを深める経験を重視し、行事やクラブ活動では協力し社会性を養います。自立と協働の姿勢を育てることも重視します。","clubs":[{"id":7151,"name":"バレーボールⅡ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.oin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-19"},{"id":7152,"name":"バレーボールⅠ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.oin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-19"},{"id":7153,"name":"バスケットボールⅡ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.oin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-19"},{"id":7154,"name":"バスケットボールⅠ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.oin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-19"},{"id":7155,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.oin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-19"},{"id":7156,"name":"卓球Ⅱ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.oin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-19"},{"id":7157,"name":"卓球Ⅰ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.oin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-19"},{"id":7159,"name":"リズム水泳","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.oin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-19"},{"id":7160,"name":"天文気象","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.oin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-19"},{"id":7161,"name":"生物","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.oin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-19"},{"id":7162,"name":"物理","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.oin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-19"},{"id":7163,"name":"化学","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.oin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-19"},{"id":7164,"name":"数学","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.oin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-19"},{"id":7165,"name":"文学","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.oin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-19"},{"id":7166,"name":"かるた","categor